## Recommended Batch 9 (Opus-direct, 2 items, ~60-75K combined)

### Item 1: POS Phase 3 — interactive new-sale cart UI (T2, ~30-40K)
First real consumer of the new tRPC React client. Validates the infra in a flow
with obvious user-visible feedback.

Files to touch:
- apps/web/src/app/(tenant)/[slug]/(app)/pos/new-sale/page.tsx — convert from
  Server Component preview note → real interactive cart. Currently a Phase 3
  placeholder note (set by b4928b1 in Batch 7).
- New: apps/web/src/app/(tenant)/[slug]/(app)/pos/new-sale/cart-client.tsx
  ("use client") — product search + add-to-cart + quantity stepper + payment
  method picker + checkout button.
- Use: trpc.pos.session.list.useQuery({ status: 'open' }) for the active session,
  trpc.inventory.product.list.useQuery for catalog (already exists), and
  trpc.pos.sale.create.useMutation for checkout. All already implemented server-side.
- Cart state: local React useState (no need for global store yet).
- 5-8 new tests in pos.test.ts covering create-from-cart happy path + edge cases
  (no open session, insufficient stock, empty cart).

### Item 2: CRM Phase 2 — contact log + quotation workflows (T2, ~30-35K)
