## Pre-flight checks before starting Batch 9
1. `grep -rn "ContactLog\|Quotation" packages/db/prisma/schema.prisma` — confirm
   models exist or scope a migration into the item.
2. `cat apps/web/src/app/(tenant)/\[slug\]/(app)/pos/new-sale/page.tsx` — re-read
   the current Phase 3 placeholder note to anchor the rewrite.
3. Verify TRPCProvider is wired (it is, since Batch 8 b02ac0b on main).
4. Verify trpc.pos.sale.create router signature accepts what cart-client.tsx
   will send (items array shape).

